sequenceDiagram
  participant C as client
  participant R as room (server)
  participant G as GitLab
  Note over C,G: open
  R->>G: no meta: load the branch head<br/>(.typ as text, others as blob sha)
  G-->>R: files, assets, meta
  R->>G: stored room: pull upstream (merge),<br/>ignoring GitLab being unreachable
  Note over C,G: save
  C->>R: gitlab:save<br/>(stateless)
  R->>G: head still the base? then one<br/>POST /repository/commits (the bot's token)
  G-->>R: head moved (ErrConflict): merge upstream,<br/>retry (3 attempts), a conflict ends the save
  Note over C,G: auto
  Note over R,G: AutoCommit (10 min) after the last edit,<br/>or LeaveDelay (20 s) after the last user left<br/>(Left waits, someone back: no commit)
  R->>G: the same commit,<br/>message naming the editors
  Note over C,G: webhook
  G->>R: POST /gitlab/webhook<br/>(X-Gitlab-Token)
  Note over R: merge into the open<br/>rooms of that branch
  Note over C,G: answers
  R-->>C: gitlab:saved / merged / conflict<br/>to everyone
  R-->>C: gitlab:unchanged / error to the saver<br/>(auto: errors to everyone)
